  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A cruelty-free brush featuring unique vegan fiber technology and custom bristles for effortless blending and even application. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Formulation:</strong> Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable </p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Intended to mimic the delicate and precise control of fingertips, this luxurious brush is specially designed to enhance the performance of Ambient Soft Glow Foundation. The unique, laser-cut design allows for maximum control for seamless application.</p><p><strong>Size: </strong><span style=\"background-color: var(--palette-white, #ffffff);\">5.5 L x .33W inches</span></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-After applying primer, apply foundation to the center of the face and blend outward using the Ambient Soft Glow Foundation Brush.<br>-Gently buff into skin and build until desired level of coverage is achieved.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A cruelty-free brush featuring unique vegan fiber technology and custom bristles for effortless blending and even application. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Formulation:</strong> Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable </p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Intended to mimic the delicate and precise control of fingertips, this luxurious brush is specially designed to enhance the performance of Ambient Soft Glow Foundation. The unique, laser-cut design allows for maximum control for seamless application.</p><p><strong>Size: </strong><span style=\"background-color: var(--palette-white, #ffffff);\">5.5 L x .33W inches</span></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-After applying primer, apply foundation to the center of the face and blend outward using the Ambient Soft Glow Foundation Brush.<br>-Gently buff into skin and build until desired level of coverage is achieved.</div></details>",
